{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14175","headline":"成都暮雨秋 · 戎昱","name":"成都暮雨秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九月龟城暮，愁人闭草堂。\n地卑多雨润，天暖少秋霜。\n纵欲倾新酒，其如忆故乡。\n不知更漏意，惟向客边长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}